# Bumi, Unleashed: "When Bumi enters, earthbend 4." (CR 701.66a): cast on turn 3 with Black Lotus (RRR), Mox Emerald and Mox Jet, it
# makes Forest#1 a 4/4 haste land creature. On turn 5 Bot1 taps Forest#2 for mana and attacks with Bumi (5) and the Forest
# creature (4), keeping Memnite (1/1) at home: Bot2 takes 9. "Untap all lands you control" untaps both Forests (the attacking
# land creature too), and "after this phase, there is an additional combat phase. Only land creatures can attack during that
# combat phase": made as the ability resolves, no trigger (CR 611.2a), so nothing is on the stack as that phase begins. Memnite is
# refused, the Forest creature attacks again for 4 more: Bot2 is at 7.

